ource-block-2281","Filter",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-2294","Low-pass filter. Saved cutoff: 0.101; resonance: 0.512. Microfreak/UG/07 Filter/01 Modifying Sound/01 Low Pass Filter",["Notes","Filter"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-2631","Envelopes",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-2647","Main envelope: attack 0.669, decay/release 0.579, sustain 0.781. Amp Mod is on, so the main envelope controls loudness. Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen/03 Envelope Stages",["Notes","Envelopes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-3091","Cycling Envelope mode: Loop. Stored RiseLvl 0.213, RiseSlp 0.500, FallLvl 0.637, FallSlp 0.500, Hold 0.000, Amount 1.000. Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen/06 Cycling Envelope",["Notes","Envelopes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-3854","LFO",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-3864","Sawtooth, clock sync on; stored division code: 8. Microfreak/UG/08 LFO/01 LFO Shape · Microfreak/UG/08 LFO/02 LFO Rate",["Notes","LFO"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4137","Modulation matrix",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4161","Amounts use the signed normalized range −1…+1. Microfreak/UG/05 Connections/02 Matrix and Encoder/01 Sources and Destinations",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4352","Cycling Envelope → Pitch: +0.004.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4451","PRESSURE → Wave: +0.170.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4563","ENV → Timbre: +0.968.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4688","PRESSURE → Timbre: +0.486.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4804","ENV → Cutoff: +0.328.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4953","PRESSURE → Cutoff: +0.187.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5093","LFO → Assign 1 → Noise: +0.203.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5296","PRESSURE → Assign 2 → Noise: −0.125.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5497","All other saved matrix amounts are zero.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5542","Voice and keyboard",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5567","Paraphonic mode: on.",["Notes","Voice and keyboard"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5651","Performance and session context",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5689","Held notes swell in slowly. The main envelope adds Fold (+0.968) and opens the cutoff (+0.328) as each note opens. Key pressure adds Saturate (+0.170), Fold (+0.486) and cutoff (+0.187) and lowers Noise through Assign 2 (−0.125); the synced sawtooth LFO adds Noise through Assign 1 (+0.203).",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5987","The PRESSURE matrix row follows the instrument's global expression setting, which the export does not record.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-6101","Turning Shape up raises Noise and makes the pad work as a noisy bass in the low register, as heard from 05:15 in GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-6294","In that session the Launchpad Pro played it from 00:00 to 18:17. Recorded knob changes covered the main and cycling envelopes, filter amount, Spice, LFO rate and the three oscillator controls, with brief cutoff and resonance changes. A read of slot 259 after the session matched the October 25 export, so the slot still holds the factory sound. The session MIDI holds those knob changes as controller messages.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-6709","Evidence and interpretation",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-6743","Values describe saved base settings before modulation. Controls use normalized 0…1 values unless a stored choice code is shown; they are not OLED percentages, hertz or milliseconds.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-6931","The saved-parameter inspector preserves the original fields. Oscillator interpretation assumes the documented firmware 5 layout; firmware is not detected from the export.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-7204","Matrix assignments follow the Freakout live map. Mode, LFO shape, filter type and octave labels follow the MicroFreak Reader definitions.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-1031","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-1041","Saved export and provenance",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-1075","Saved export: read from the device's slot 260 over USB on October 25, 2026 with mise run microfreak:download --slot 260. Two consecutive reads returned the same file.",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-1248","The parameter payload matches the MIDI Control Center archives Factory 3.0, Factory 6.0 (Factory 3.0 slot 327, Factory 6.0 slot 177). Comparison used mise run microfreak:compare.",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-1433","Download the slot 260 capture. It is the raw device format (header plus data packets), not an .mbp file; see .",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-1750","Oscillator",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-1767","Model: Bass. Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-1919","Saturate: 0.146. Fold: 0.201. Noise: 0.000.",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-2128","Keyboard octave: +2. Glide: 0.000.",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-2271","Filter",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-2284","Low-pass filter. Saved cutoff: 0.370; resonance: 0.158. Microfreak/UG/07 Filter/01 Modifying Sound/01 Low Pass Filter",["Notes","Filter"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-2621","Envelopes",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-2637","Main envelope: attack 0.000, decay/release 0.369, sustain 0.000. Amp Mod is on, so the main envelope controls loudness. Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen/03 Envelope Stages",["Notes","Envelopes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-3081","Cycling Envelope mode: Run. Stored RiseLvl 0.256, RiseSlp 0.311, FallLvl 0.278, FallSlp 0.647, Hold 0.000, Amount 0.000. Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen/06 Cycling Envelope",["Notes","Envelopes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-3842","LFO",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-3852","Square, clock sync off; stored normalized rate: 0.804. Microfreak/UG/08 LFO/01 LFO Shape · Microfreak/UG/08 LFO/02 LFO Rate",["Notes","LFO"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-4179","Modulation matrix",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-4203","Amounts use the signed normalized range −1…+1. Microfreak/UG/05 Connections/02 Matrix and Encoder/01 Sources and Destinations",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-4394","Cycling Envelope → Pitch: +0.011.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-4493","LFO → Pitch: +0.073.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-4568","PRESSURE → Wave: +0.373.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-4680","PRESSURE → Timbre: +1.000.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-4796","Cycling Envelope → Cutoff: +0.005.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-4964","ENV → Cutoff: +0.444.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-5113","KEY/ARP → Assign 3 → Mat.Assign3: −0.137.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-5268","All other saved matrix amounts are zero.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-5313","Voice and keyboard",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-5338","Paraphonic mode: off.",["Notes","Voice and keyboard"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-5423","Performance and session context",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-5461","A short lead two octaves up: the main envelope has no attack and no sustain, and it opens the cutoff (+0.444) on each note. Key pressure is the main expressive control, driving Fold at full amount (+1.000) and Saturate (+0.373). The square LFO adds a small pitch modulation (+0.073) whose speed follows the LFO rate.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-5782","The PRESSURE matrix row follows the instrument's global expression setting, which the export does not record.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-5896","The Assign 3 destination is unresolved. Its saved destination ID is 0x0904, which the Freakout live map lists as an address of the Assign 3 field itself. Assign 3 stores the same ID in 70 of the 384 Factory 6.0 presets. In the session commentary at 21:28, the instrument shows this KEY/ARP → Assign 3 destination as \"move\".",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-6321","In GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun it was played from the MicroFreak keys from 18:17 to the end, with almost continuous pressure and pitch bends from 22:46. Recorded knob changes covered attack, decay, sustain, the cycling envelope, filter amount, the free LFO rate, Noise and Fold. At 25:15 pressure was routed through Assign 1 to the main envelope's attack, a matrix edit the capture does not record. A read of slot 260 after the session matched the October 25 export, so the slot still holds the factory sound. The session MIDI holds the knob changes as controller messages.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-6903","Evidence and interpretation",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-6937","Values describe saved base settings before modulation. Controls use normalized 0…1 values unless a stored choice code is shown; they are not OLED percentages, hertz or milliseconds.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-7125","The saved-parameter inspector preserves the original fields. Oscillator interpretation assumes the documented firmware 5 layout; firmware is not detected from the export.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/260%208bitfi/","source-block-7398","Matrix assignments follow the Freakout live map. Mode, LFO shape, filter type and octave labels follow the MicroFreak Reader definitions.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/261%20Eurgon%20Lead/","source-block-535","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/262%20Pled/","source-block-534","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/263%20Giraf/","source-block-530","Notes",[]],